genbu-robot (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Replace Docker bringup with pixi bringup.
  * Ship pixi.toml and pixi.lock in /etc/genbu-robot/ and run the robot
    stack via `pixi run -e robot` from the systemd service.
  * Add genbu-robot-install-pixi: installs the pixi binary to
    /usr/local/bin at package install time.
  * Remove Docker dependencies, docker-compose.yml installation, and
    genbu-robot-docker-update.

 -- Natesh Narain <nnaraindev@gmail.com>  Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

genbu-robot (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add genbu-robot-update script for self-updating the Debian package from
    GitHub releases. Run `sudo genbu-robot-update` on the robot to pull and
    install the latest release.

