genbu-robot (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rename package from genbu-robot-service to genbu-robot.
  * Rename systemd service from genbu-robot-service to robot.
  * Add Bluetooth gamepad dependencies: bluetooth, bluez, bluez-tools, joystick.
  * Enable and start bluetooth service on package installation.
  * Pass joystick device through to the Docker container.

